# Dependencies & build output — reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Secrets & local env — never bake into an image (pass at runtime instead).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS, editor, OS cruft.
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Docker/CI files themselves.
.github
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
